  title: "Limit of Detection in Avian PCR Testing",
  h1: "Limit of Detection in Avian PCR Testing",
  description: "What limit of blank, limit of detection, and limit of quantification mean in avian PCR, how laboratories measure them, and why a lower LoD does not make a bird sexing test better.",
  canonical: "/limit-of-detection-avian-pcr/",
  author: "SENO Testing Center",
